1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,214
Part three. Setting up your company.

2
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:07,523
Open Settings from the Home screen.

3
00:00:07,523 --> 00:00:14,911
The General tab is your company profile: name, GSTIN, PAN, state, phone, email,

4
00:00:14,911 --> 00:00:17,249
bank details and address.

5
00:00:17,249 --> 00:00:21,270
These print on every quotation and invoice.

6
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:28,897
The state matters: it decides CGST plus SGST for customers in your state,

7
00:00:28,897 --> 00:00:30,740
and IGST for others.

8
00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:35,716
If you type the GSTIN, the state is filled in from it.

9
00:00:35,716 --> 00:00:38,481
Change what you need and save.

10
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:44,454
The Sales tab sets how long quotations stay valid, the default terms,

11
00:00:44,454 --> 00:00:50,423
and the generation and savings estimate printed on quotations: units per kilowatt

12
00:00:50,423 --> 00:00:53,075
per day and your electricity tariff.

13
00:00:53,970 --> 00:00:58,768
The Accounts tab has the payment terms that set each invoice's due date.

14
00:00:58,768 --> 00:01:02,833
Purchase and stock chooses the warehouse where deliveries go.

15
00:01:03,730 --> 00:01:08,727
Documents and print is where you add your logo and signature,

16
00:01:08,727 --> 00:01:12,824
choose a print layout and colour, and your UPI ID.

17
00:01:12,824 --> 00:01:18,149
With a UPI ID, every invoice prints a QR code for the amount due,

18
00:01:18,149 --> 00:01:20,852
so customers can pay by scanning.

19
00:01:21,770 --> 00:01:26,007
In the WhatsApp tab, enter your business WhatsApp number,

20
00:01:26,007 --> 00:01:28,980
which prints on quotations and invoices.

21
00:01:28,980 --> 00:01:32,548
Below are the messages the WhatsApp button uses.

22
00:01:32,548 --> 00:01:37,529
One tap switches them all to Hindi, and you can change any of them.

23
00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:42,691
Next video: Team members, roles and access rights.

